<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 2100s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 22nd century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 2100s BCE, 27 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 6 were founded and 7 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Uruk, the Elamite Confederation and the Mari.</p></header>
